# Scope overrides for the parity tooling. The top-level .gitignore excludes audio files, *.log and
# JSON data globally; the golden corpus and the gate evidence must be committed. Re-inclusion works
# here because no parent *directory* of these files is excluded.

.venv/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Derived and large. Regenerated by run_oracles.py, transferred to the mini by scp. The
# reproducibility receipt for all of it is fixtures/MANIFEST.sha256 (committed below).
fixtures/traces/
fixtures/layers/
fixtures/refmix/
*.f32
*.jsonl

# Committed: deterministic audio inputs, small text goldens, the receipt, and gate evidence.
!fixtures/audio/**
!fixtures/LICENSES.md
!fixtures/profiles/**
!fixtures/prep/**
!fixtures/MANIFEST.sha256
!evidence/**
